class: runtime
profiles: standard
summary: D241 keeps the ordinary computed element store bounds trap before addressing storage
constructs: 0080, 0160, 0520, 0540, 0570, 1800, 1810, 1900, 1920, 1950, 1960
program: main.ldn
traps: yes
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, darwin-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64, windows-x86-64, windows-arm64
